    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>House Filled With Cats</i> invites you into a delightful world of hand-drawn whimsy, where curiosity leads to discovery, and every corner holds a feline surprise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this charming hidden object game, your mission is simple but captivating: explore a beautifully illustrated home brimming with coziness and warmth as you search for all the playful, sneaky cats hiding throughout. Each room is packed with charming details, inviting you to slow down and take in the artistic beauty as you hunt for your elusive furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413680/extras/4a6c0c60206623db3d1a1290c84e9b12.poster.avif?t=1740045360\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413680/extras/4a6c0c60206623db3d1a1290c84e9b12.webm?t=1740045360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413680/extras/4a6c0c60206623db3d1a1290c84e9b12.mp4?t=1740045360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical Hand-Drawn Art:</strong> Enjoy lovingly crafted illustrations filled with charm and heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-Finding Fun:</strong> Discover mischievous cats hiding under pillows, behind furniture, or in unexpected spots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Atmosphere:</strong> Perfect for when you want to relax and unwind with lighthearted, wholesome gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for Everyone:</strong> Simple gameplay that anyone can pick up and enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned cat lover or just enjoy charming, artistic adventures, <i>House Filled With Cats</i> promises a playful and heartwarming experience that will leave you smiling. Dive in, get cozy, and start your cat-finding journey today!</p>",
